    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d479">

                <pb facs="0796" n="786" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg786"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The War Department to Lieutenant General Albert C.
                        Wedemeyer </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-21">21 January 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>93933. Plan for operation of 25 Liberty ships as given in your 20771<anchor
                        n="33" xml:id="d479-f1"/> is approved. Submit flag specifications to permit
                    coordination with Navy here. Details on organization and duties of Staff Agency
                    together with other information on progress made in implementing your plan would
                    be most helpful.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
